  403                                   
  404                                   ; Take over Timers A and D: save everything YX6_stop must hand back, park our
  405                                   ; handlers on the vectors, leave both timers stopped but enabled and unmasked.
  406                                   ; bset/bclr only - Timer C's bits and the ACIA's live in the same registers.
